  "summary": "Doe stored only 16 bindings per compute bind group. The unchanged cpp-ml Presentation pass uses 18 bindings, so its instructions texture at binding 16 and uniform buffer at binding 17 were silently absent from Vulkan descriptor state. The missing descriptors produced a GPUVM read fault whose manifestation depended on allocation layout. Native compute capacity is now 32 bindings per group, total shader-reflection capacity is 32, and the four-group flattened mask is 128 bits.",
